### 1. Success rate under 40% over the last hour, for one agent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alert-rules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qarz undirish — muvaffaqiyat tushdi",
  "metric": "SUCCESS_RATE",
  "comparator": "BELOW",
  "threshold": 40,
  "windowMinutes": 60,
  "minCalls": 20,
  "cooldownMinutes": 120,
  "aiAgentId": 1
}

### 2. No calls in the last 30 minutes (the trunk or the dialer went quiet)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alert-rules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qo'ng'iroqlar to'xtadi",
  "metric": "CALL_COUNT",
  "comparator": "BELOW",
  "threshold": 1,
  "windowMinutes": 30
}

### 3. What rule 1 sees right now
GET http://localhost:8080/api/alert-rules/1/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. The company's rules
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alert-rules/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 20, "enabled": true }

### 5. Delete rule 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/alert-rules/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
